---
// Drafting-sheet marker in the page margin. The labels are already authored on
// every section as `data-screen-label` ("05 Datengrundlage") — this renders
// them, giving the page one architectural through-line and a sense of place.
// Shown only when the margin actually affords it, measured rather than assumed.
---

<div
  data-sheet-index
  class="pointer-events-none fixed left-4 top-1/2 z-40 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 select-none"
  aria-hidden="true"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
    <span class="h-10 w-px bg-ink/20"></span>
    <span
      data-sheet-label
      class="font-mono text-2xs uppercase tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap text-ink-ghost [writing-mode:vertical-rl]"
    ></span>
    <span class="h-10 w-px bg-ink/20"></span>
  </div>
</div>
